        },
        {
          "text": "Akawaamuru, akasema, Mimi ninakwenda kukusanywa pamoja na watu wangu; mnizike pamoja na baba zangu, katika pango iliyomo shambani mwa Efroni, Mhiti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
